<title>ISRAEL: Israeli army chief to visit France.</title>
<headline>Israeli army chief to visit France.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel said its army chief, Lieutenant-General Amnon Shahak, would leave on Monday for a brief working visit to France.</p>
<p>An Israeli army spokesman said Shahak, accompanied by Israel's operations chief Major-General Gabi Ashkenazi, would meet his French counterpart and visit French army units.</p>
</text>
